{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to <i>One-In</i></strong> \u2013 a tactical first-person multiplayer game of <strong>risk, deception, and pure psychological pressure</strong>. Each round, you spin the revolver, but this isn\u2019t luck. It\u2019s strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/GAMEMODES.png?t=1748458678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/RUSSIANROULLETEE.png?t=1748458678\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin the gun. Pull the trigger. The room goes silent...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive an ability if you choose to shoot yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/BLACKJACKKK.png?t=1748458678\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play it safe or push your luck. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic card mechanics with a deadly twist. Lose, and it\u2019s your head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive an ability every new round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer up to 4 People</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short 15-20 minutes gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672740?t=1748458678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672740?t=1748458678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/d8d182fa9f4751c29dbbbef5413bb84edb97c3b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748458678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/d8d182fa9f4751c29dbbbef5413bb84edb97c3b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748458678","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has 3 modes: Russian Roulette, Blackjack, and King's Liar. The loser gets shot, but there\u2019s no blood or gore, just loud sound effects. You play as a robot, and everything is more stylized than realistic. There\u2019s no human violence, no sexual content, or anything like that, just intense rounds with high stakes and a dark vibe."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to <i>One-In</i></strong> \u2013 a tactical first-person multiplayer game of <strong>risk, deception, and pure psychological pressure</strong>. Each round, you spin the revolver, but this isn\u2019t luck. It\u2019s strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/GAMEMODES.png?t=1748458678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/RUSSIANROULLETEE.png?t=1748458678\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin the gun. Pull the trigger. The room goes silent...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive an ability if you choose to shoot yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/BLACKJACKKK.png?t=1748458678\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play it safe or push your luck. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic card mechanics with a deadly twist. Lose, and it\u2019s your head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive an ability every new round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer up to 4 People</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short 15-20 minutes gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["RacSolver"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/d7da33ecce8f611853c82bb335a4a1a368703a59/header.jpg?t=1748458678","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>One-In \u00a9 RacSolver 2025. All rights reserved.  </strong><br>This game was made using Unity. Unity is a trademark of Unity Technologies.  <br>All other trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"One-In","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-8100 / Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti / RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated, 